,{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-04-03T00:50:17Z","updated_at":"2025-06-01T11:49:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4.1 \n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-9700K CPU @ 3.60GHz (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nString.get_slice(delimiter, slice) is not following -1 index expectations and is not documented about it.\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/classes/class_string.html#class-string-method-get-slice\n\nmy expectation was that text.get_slice(\" \", -1) returns the last word in \"text\" but it returns nothing. \nit turns out that on minus values it just returns an empty string before even looking at the input string.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/1f56d96cf2c768c3844c68ccb504dfeee841ae15/core/string/ustring.cpp#L1011-L1049\nline 1019 should have at least a warning or soft error.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- make a string with a few words in it.\n- use the function on it\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104948/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104948/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}